docs {
Login sebagai contributor (role default hasil seed `pnpm seed`).
Token disimpan ke variable TERPISAH `contributor_access_token` - jangan
menimpa `access_token` milik admin yang dipakai request lain.

Dipakai alur approval gate (Section 22): submit contributor masuk
antrean review (pending_review), diverifikasi lewat folder contribution/.

200 sukses - bentuk sama seperti Login admin:

    { "success": true, "data": { "access_token": "eyJ…", "user": { "role": "contributor", … } } }
}

meta {
  name: Login Contributor
  seq: 10
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
  body: json
  auth: none
}

body:json {
  {
    "email": "{{contributor_email}}",
    "password": "{{contributor_password}}"
  }
}

vars:post-response {
  contributor_access_token: res.body.data.access_token
  contributor_username: res.body.data.user.username
}

tests {
  test("200 + contributor_access_token + role contributor", () => {
    expect(res.status).to.equal(200);
    expect(res.body.data.access_token).to.be.a('string');
    expect(res.body.data.user.role).to.equal('contributor');
  });
}
